# Environment variables — LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY.
# Production (Vercel) needs NO environment variables: the frontend calls
# relative /api/* on the same domain and the root vercel.json routes those
# requests to the FastAPI backend service.
#
# Backend: no env vars required. The Elexon BMRS base URL is a constant in
# backend/app/config.py (https://data.elexon.co.uk/bmrs/api/v1); no API key.
#
# Frontend (local dev only): if you run the React dev server (port 3000)
# against a local backend (port 8000), create frontend/.env.local with:
#   REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
# Leave it unset for production builds and Docker (nginx/Vercel proxy /api/*).
